<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 5, PLN 4.5.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 5, PLN 4.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three kerb transactions in Polish construction firm Mostostal Krakow SA were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday.</p>
<p>A block of 300,000 shares went at five zlotys per share while two blocks of 800,000 shares went at 4.5 zlotys.</p>
<p>Shares in Mostostal Krakow, which chose not to conduct a public offering, start trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
